{
  "id": "6a8eac2d2b2edd4e70376b2f",
  "title": "嫌なことを表明がどういう意味かわからない",
  "created": 1787735087,
  "updated": 1787740165,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8eac2d2b2edd4e70376b2f",
      "text": "嫌なことを表明がどういう意味かわからない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735087,
      "updated": 1787735087
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac2f0000000000fad092",
      "text": "[**** [嫌なことを表明]]（空ページ）ってどういう意味ですか？空ページなので手がかりがなく、よくわからないのですが[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735087,
      "updated": 1787737564
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac300000000000fad093",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735088,
      "updated": 1787735088
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb1290000000000fad0a2",
      "text": "[リンクの話を調べる]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736361,
      "updated": 1787736366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb12f0000000000fad0a3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736367,
      "updated": 1787736367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ead960000000000fad09d",
      "text": "[わかったつもり]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735447,
      "updated": 1787735460
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eaf9700000000000a9e3c",
      "text": "[行動変容]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735959,
      "updated": 1787735959
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eada00000000000fad09e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735456,
      "updated": 1787735456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac320000000000fad094",
      "text": "[嫌なことを表明するのが良いという文化]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735091,
      "updated": 1787735127
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac590000000000fad098",
      "text": "[嫌なことを表明するのは注意が必要という文化]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735129,
      "updated": 1787739837
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ebebb0000000000da7857",
      "text": " どういうことだろう？",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787739838,
      "updated": 1787739848
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac4b0000000000fad097",
      "text": "[私が嫌なことを表明出来るということは、あなたも嫌なことを表明して良いということ]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735116,
      "updated": 1787735163
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb2df0000000000fad0a4",
      "text": "　[返報性]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736799,
      "updated": 1787736806
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac7b0000000000fad09a",
      "text": "[嫌なことを表明された後]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735164,
      "updated": 1787735171
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac830000000000fad09b",
      "text": "[嫌じゃないことを表明]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735172,
      "updated": 1787739942
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac8d0000000000fad09c",
      "text": "[嫌なら見るな]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735181,
      "updated": 1787735190
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eac6a0000000000fad099",
      "text": "[誰かにとって不快かもしれない]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735147,
      "updated": 1787736110
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb02f0000000000fad09f",
      "text": "[「誰かにとって不快かもしれない」と延々と考え続けていたら何も書けなくなる]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736111,
      "updated": 1787736173
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb06e0000000000fad0a0",
      "text": "[それをやられると嫌です]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736174,
      "updated": 1787740067
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ebf9d0000000000da7859",
      "text": "[ウザがられても、嫌われても、その人のことが好きなら、そう思うことをやめない]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787740062,
      "updated": 1787740165
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ebfe50000000000da785a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787740133,
      "updated": 1787740133
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eae9f00000000000a9e2d",
      "text": "[嫌悪を表明]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735711,
      "updated": 1787735716
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eaea000000000000a9e2e",
      "text": "[要望を表明]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735713,
      "updated": 1787735791
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb7e600000000000a9e42",
      "text": "[不満を表明]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787738087,
      "updated": 1787738097
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eaeec00000000000a9e2f",
      "text": "[上手い不快の表明のやりかた]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735788,
      "updated": 1787735854
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb0e50000000000fad0a1",
      "text": "[良い意見かどうかは1人だと中々わからないので、とりあえず言ってみたほうが良い]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736293,
      "updated": 1787736294
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb3220000000000fad0a5",
      "text": "[個人の感想]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736867,
      "updated": 1787736872
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eaf7600000000000a9e31",
      "text": "[何か不満があっても言わずに黙ってしまう]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787735927,
      "updated": 1787736293
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eafd400000000000a9e3d",
      "text": "[合意のない期待]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736021,
      "updated": 1787736461
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb18a00000000000a9e3e",
      "text": "[相互理解]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787736459,
      "updated": 1787737167
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb44c00000000000a9e3f",
      "text": "[独自のルール・こだわり]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787737164,
      "updated": 1787737690
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb6c800000000000a9e41",
      "text": "[細かいことを指摘されるとやや不愉快になるので自重して欲しい]（空ページ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787737800,
      "updated": 1787737821
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8eb65600000000000a9e40",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787737686,
      "updated": 1787737686
    },
